WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.433 --> 00:00:01.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers
And this is "Late Night."

00:00:01.935 --> 00:00:03.036 line:92%
How is everybody doing tonight

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:05.038 line:92%
New York is back, you guys

00:00:05.038 --> 00:00:08.241 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's beautiful out,
and the CDC just said

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:12.379 line:92%
rats don't have to wear masks.

00:00:12.379 --> 00:00:13.546 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:13.546 --> 00:00:17.183 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, we get to see their cute
little faces again.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.385 size:81% position:41% line:92%
Let's get to the news.

00:00:18.385 --> 00:00:21.087 align:start size:94% position:6%
You guys, I'm not
a superstitious man.

00:00:21.087 --> 00:00:22.922 line:92%
All I'm saying is that Biden

00:00:22.922 --> 00:00:24.724 align:start size:94% position:6%
took one picture
with Jimmy Carter,

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:26.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
and now there's a crisis
in the Middle East,

00:00:26.626 --> 00:00:29.763 align:start size:94% position:6%
a gasoline shortage,
and low-rise jeans are back.

00:00:29.763 --> 00:00:31.498 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't want to
be disrespectful,

00:00:31.498 --> 00:00:33.700 line:92%
but he might be a leprechaun

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.568 align:start size:94% position:6%
"Let me get a picture with you
Jimmy.

00:00:35.568 --> 00:00:37.871 align:start size:94% position:6%
Oh, you'll get the picture
all right!"

00:00:37.871 --> 00:00:38.605 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Take it down!

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:42.442 align:start size:94% position:6%
The Colonial Pipeline
restarted operations yesterday

00:00:42.442 --> 00:00:44.778 align:start size:94% position:6%
five days after being shut dow
by a cyberattack,

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:48.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is good because we wer
reaching dangerous levels

00:00:48.615 --> 00:00:50.984 line:92%
of smugness in Tesla owners.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:53.686 align:start size:94% position:6%
House Minority Leader
Kevin McCarthy yesterday

00:00:53.686 --> 00:00:55.155 line:92%
pushed back against claims

00:00:55.155 --> 00:00:58.992
that Republicans are still
focused on the 2020 election

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:00.894 line:92%
and said, "I don't think anybody

00:01:00.894 --> 00:01:04.631
is questioning the legitimac
of the presidential election."

00:01:04.631 --> 00:01:07.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
Added McCarthy, "And I think
Vice President Biden

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.868 size:84% position:42% line:92%
would agree with that."

00:01:08.868 --> 00:01:10.070 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right, Kevin McCarthy
said that

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:13.373
no one is questioning the
legitimacy of the 2020 election.

00:01:13.373 --> 00:01:15.308 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then he said, "Oh,
that's my phone.

00:01:15.308 --> 00:01:18.011 align:start size:94% position:6%
Who do I know in Florida?
Oh."

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:20.413 size:75% position:38%
The New York Yankees
announced yesterday

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:23.083 align:start size:94% position:6%
that at least seven member
of the coaching staff

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.285 size:75% position:38%
have tested positive
for the coronavirus

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:27.287 align:start size:94% position:6%
despite
all receiving the vaccine.

00:01:27.287 --> 00:01:31.591
And that's weird because usually
when Yankees get injections,

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:33.893 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
they work.

00:01:33.893 --> 00:01:38.465 align:start size:94% position:6%
Wally, did you get that one,
Wally? Did you get it?

00:01:38.465 --> 00:01:39.265 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-No.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:43.236 align:start size:94% position:6%
-When asked the median price
for a home in Brooklyn,

00:01:43.236 --> 00:01:44.604 line:92%
former City Housing Commissioner

00:01:44.604 --> 00:01:47.307 align:start size:94% position:6%
and New York mayoral candidate
Shaun Donovan

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:48.808 line:92%
vastly underestimated the cost

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:52.145
and said that the average pric
of a home is $80,000 to $90,000,

00:01:52.145 --> 00:01:56.683 align:start size:94% position:6%
which, in his defense,
is the average price of a home

00:01:56.683 --> 00:02:00.320 line:92%
for your car in Brooklyn.

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:01.354 line:92%
According to a new study,

00:02:01.354 --> 00:02:03.890 align:start size:94% position:6%
the coronavirus can stay
in men's genitals

00:02:03.890 --> 00:02:06.626 align:start size:94% position:6%
for a long period of time
after recovery.

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:10.363 line:92%
Said men, "Challenge accepted.

00:02:10.363 --> 00:02:13.266 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.266 --> 00:02:15.301 align:start size:94% position:6%
According to a new report,
the United States

00:02:15.301 --> 00:02:17.036 align:start size:94% position:6%
is experiencing
a chicken shortage

00:02:17.036 --> 00:02:21.374
because roosters are not meeting
breeding expectations.

00:02:21.374 --> 00:02:25.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
Said roosters,
"You told people?"

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:26.946 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.946 --> 00:02:30.250 align:start size:94% position:6%
And finally,
Swedish furniture retailer IKE

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.185 align:start size:94% position:6%
announced yesterday
it will offer --

00:02:32.185 --> 00:02:35.355 align:start size:94% position:6%
it will offer
a pulled-pork sandwich

00:02:35.355 --> 00:02:36.055 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
in its restaurants,

00:02:36.055 --> 00:02:38.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
if you have the patience
to put it together.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:40.727 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
And that --

00:02:40.727 --> 00:02:41.561 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughs ]

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:45.365
A lot of --
Got a lot of farm humor tonight.

